    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue2.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[0]'
      value: ...why did you do that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[1]'
      value: You were supposed to go into the cave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[2]'
      value: But instead, you used iframes to go through them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[3]'
      value: I mean, I guess this way is faster.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[4]'
      value: Whatever, go have fun taking damage.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[0]'
      value: Imagine how cool it would be if there was another path.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[1]'
      value: Like going this way would change the ending.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8740465274458733762, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[2]'
      value: A route like that? Kinda weird...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 5365b01e649ac854c82d33895f30d159, type: 3}
